# Inherits the root .clang-tidy and relaxes checks that only make sense for
# production code. Scoped to tests/ so production code keeps the full set.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-exception-escape,
  -cert-err58-cpp

# Rationale:
#   bugprone-exception-escape  Test and self-test mains use iostreams and
#                              containers that may throw, and a throwing test
#                              main is a test failure, not a defect. The
#                              sanitizer self-tests terminate on purpose.
#   cert-err58-cpp             GoogleTest's TEST() macros create static objects
#                              whose constructors can throw by design.
